{
  "key": 58463,
  "messages": [
    {
      "id": "msg_0584_T25R0201_00000",
      "en_US": [
        "Sigh... I opened a branch here,\n",
        "but I can’t sell my Bicycles.\f",
        "Why is that?\r",
        "Could you ride a Bicycle and\n",
        "advertise for me? {YESNO 0}"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0584_T25R0201_00001",
      "en_US": [
        "Really? Great!\r",
        "Give me your name and phone number,\n",
        "and I’ll loan you a Bicycle. {YESNO 0}"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0584_T25R0201_00002",
      "garbage": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0584_T25R0201_00003",
      "en_US": [
        "The main shop is at Cerulean\n",
        "back in Kanto.\r",
        "Say hello to the shop manager\n",
        "if you happen to go there!\r",
        "Our Bicycles are first-rate!\n",
        "You can ride them in Kanto, too!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0584_T25R0201_00004",
      "en_US": [
        "Sigh... Oh, for the kindness\n",
        "of people..."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0584_T25R0201_00005",
      "en_US": "It’s a rusty old bicycle..."
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0584_T25R0201_00006",
      "en_US": [
        "Cynthia: {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}! It’s good to see you\n",
        "again. This is an in-progress base that\f",
        "is built for archaeologists, so it’s\f",
        "a good place for me to stay around!\r",
        "Cynthia: You know, if you find or get\n",
        "given any ancient looking items, you\f",
        "should bring them to me. I might be\f",
        "able to help decipher their meaning."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0584_T25R0201_00007",
      "en_US": [
        "Cynthia: If you find anything\n",
        "interesting that looks ancient,\f",
        "bring it to me. I might be able to\f",
        "shed some light on it."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0584_T25R0201_00008",
      "en_US": [
        "Cynthia: What is this item? Professor\n",
        "Oak gave it to you? Hmm...\r",
        "He said it’s called the Lock Capsule?\r",
        "I heard this is somehow related to\n",
        "the golems of legend...\r",
        "Let me try something a moment..."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0584_T25R0201_00009",
      "en_US": [
        "Cynthia: The capsule reacted very\n",
        "strongly to that braille tablet\f",
        "I obtained from the Hoenn region...\r",
        "The Lock Capsule seems to be giving off\n",
        "an aura!\r",
        "I wonder what that could mean.\r",
        "Perhaps the golems have surfaced\n",
        "around Johto?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0584_T25R0201_00010",
      "en_US": [
        "Cynthia: Are you searching for\n",
        "Regirock, Regice, and Registeel?\r",
        "It’s hard to guess, but could they’ve\n",
        "appeared within Johto’s caves?\r",
        "It might be worth your while to take a\n",
        "deep look inside some of them."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0584_T25R0201_00011",
      "en_US": [
        "Hello, welcome to the new Goldenrod\n",
        "Archaeology Center!\r",
        "This USED to be a bike shop, but they\n",
        "haven’t cleared away half the trash...\r",
        "Ahem! Will you need my help with the\n",
        "revival of fossils, today?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0584_T25R0201_00012",
      "en_US": "Stone Market"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0584_T25R0201_00013",
      "en_US": "Fossil Revival"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0584_T25R0201_00014",
      "en_US": "Never Mind"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0584_T25R0201_00015",
      "en_US": [
        "Welcome to the Archaeology\n",
        "Center’s Fossil Service!\r",
        "Would you like me to help you? {YESNO 0}"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0584_T25R0201_00016",
      "en_US": "Come back again!"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0584_T25R0201_00017",
      "en_US": [
        "Okay!\n",
        "What would you like to get? {YESNO 0}"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0584_T25R0201_00018",
      "en_US": [
        "Fire Stone\n",
        "$3,000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0584_T25R0201_00019",
      "en_US": [
        "Thunderstone\n",
        "$3,000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0584_T25R0201_00020",
      "en_US": [
        "Water Stone\n",
        "$3,000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0584_T25R0201_00021",
      "en_US": [
        "Leaf Stone\n",
        "$3,000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0584_T25R0201_00022",
      "en_US": [
        "Sun Stone\n",
        "$5,000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0584_T25R0201_00023",
      "en_US": [
        "Moon Stone\n",
        "$5,000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0584_T25R0201_00024",
      "en_US": "Dawn Stone{CURSOR_X 90}$10,000"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0584_T25R0201_00025",
      "en_US": "Shiny Stone{CURSOR_X 90}$10,000"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0584_T25R0201_00026",
      "en_US": "Dusk Stone{CURSOR_X 90}$10,000"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0584_T25R0201_00027",
      "en_US": "Cancel"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0584_T25R0201_00028",
      "en_US": "Common Stones"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0584_T25R0201_00029",
      "en_US": "Rare Stones"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0584_T25R0201_00030",
      "en_US": [
        "Everstone\n",
        "$1,000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0584_T25R0201_00031",
      "en_US": [
        "Uh... I hate to say it, but you\n",
        "haven’t got enough money for that."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0584_T25R0201_00032",
      "en_US": [
        "Cynthia: Ah, welcome back! You engaged\n",
        "with the three golems? Intruiging...\r",
        "I wonder if we can somehow find the\n",
        "fourth golem, Regigigas.\r",
        "I’ll do some research into it.\n",
        "You should come back sometime later."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0584_T25R0201_00033",
      "en_US": [
        "If you have any fossils on you, I can\n",
        "use our technology to extract the DNA.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0584_T25R0201_00034",
      "en_US": [
        "Ah, you don’t wish to extract this\n",
        "time? Very well, then."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0584_T25R0201_00035",
      "en_US": [
        "I’ll see what I can do. Give me some\n",
        "time and come back later."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0584_T25R0201_00036",
      "en_US": [
        "I’ve extracted a {STRVAR_1 0, 0, 0} from your\n",
        "fossil. Take good care of it.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0584_T25R0201_00037",
      "en_US": [
        "Oh..!\n",
        "Your party seems full.\r",
        "Why don’t you go to the PC\n",
        "to make some room?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0584_T25R0201_00038",
      "en_US": [
        "You haven’t got any fossils...\n",
        "Maybe you should smash some rocks."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0584_T25R0201_00039",
      "en_US": [
        "Do you want to extract a Pokémon\n",
        "from the {STRVAR_1 8, 0, 0}? {YESNO 0}"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0584_T25R0201_00040",
      "en_US": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0} received\n",
        "the {STRVAR_1 0, 1, 0}!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0584_T25R0201_00041",
      "en_US": [
        "Would you like to give a nickname\n",
        "to the {STRVAR_1 0, 1, 0} you received? {YESNO 0}"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0584_T25R0201_00042",
      "en_US": [
        "Oh! Hello! Thank you for coming\n",
        "to our archaelogical center!\r",
        "This place used to be pretty\n",
        "useless...\r",
        "Then Cynthia showed up, and that all\n",
        "changed. Her prowess is incredible!\r",
        "That Steven Stone is pretty good\n",
        "with archaeology, too...\r",
        "Anyway, since this is your first visit,\n",
        "let me give you a generous gift!\r",
        "The best archaeology has to offer!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0584_T25R0201_00043",
      "en_US": [
        "You can often find these fossils if\n",
        "you check under breakable rocks.\r",
        "Treat those Skull and Armor Fossils\n",
        "with care, though. As far as Johto is\f",
        "concerned, they’re one-of-a-kind!\r",
        "You can talk to the man at the counter\n",
        "if you want to try reviving them..."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0584_T25R0201_00044",
      "en_US": [
        "Nice to see you again. Isn’t this\n",
        "place fantastic?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0584_T25R0201_00045",
      "en_US": [
        "Cynthia: Oh! Is this what they\n",
        "call the {COLOR 1}Red Chain{COLOR 0}?\r",
        "This chain may lead us to\n",
        "somewhere very special...\r",
        "Yes, I believe this will lead us\n",
        "to the {COLOR 1}Sinjoh Ruins{COLOR 0}.\r",
        "Talk to me again if you\n",
        "want to take a look."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0584_T25R0201_00046",
      "en_US": [
        "Cynthia: Talk to me again if\n",
        "you want to take a look."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0584_T25R0201_00047",
      "en_US": [
        "Cynthia: Do you want to go\n",
        "to the {COLOR 1}Sinjoh Ruins{COLOR 0}? {YESNO 0}"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0584_T25R0201_00048",
      "en_US": [
        "Woah! Isn’t that item you have there\n",
        "what they call the Enigma Stone?\r",
        "I heard about Steven’s excavation\n",
        "of that!\r",
        "Can I please take\n",
        "a look at it!? {YESNO 0}"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0584_T25R0201_00049",
      "en_US": [
        "Aww, man...\n",
        "Why not?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0584_T25R0201_00050",
      "en_US": "Yes! Thank you!\r"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0584_T25R0201_00051",
      "en_US": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0} handed the Enigma Stone\n",
        "over to the archaeologist."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0584_T25R0201_00052",
      "en_US": [
        "This is quite an interesting stone...\n",
        "Though it’s totally covered in dirt.\r",
        "Let me give it a polish...\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0584_T25R0201_00053",
      "en_US": [
        "I think... this is the legendary\n",
        "Soul Dew!\r",
        "They say it contains the {COLOR 1}spirit\n",
        "of the Eon Pokémon{COLOR 0}.\r",
        "Here, you should keep it.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0584_T25R0201_00054",
      "en_US": [
        "If by some chance you capture\n",
        "a legendary Pokémon, please show it\f",
        "to me!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0584_T25R0201_00055",
      "en_US": [
        "This trophy holds the names of\n",
        "those Pokémon who our researchers,\f",
        "past and present fought so hard\f",
        "to obtain information about.\r",
        "They are known collectively as the\n",
        "{COLOR 1}Legendary Pokémon{COLOR 0}.\r",
        "Read on?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0584_T25R0201_00056",
      "en_US": [
        "Professor Elm: So, you like {COLOR 3}Chikorita{COLOR 0},\n",
        "the Grass-type Pokémon?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0584_T25R0201_00057",
      "en_US": [
        "The {COLOR 2}Johto{COLOR 0} region is known for the\n",
        "beasts of thunder, fire and water,\f",
        "the guardians of sea and sky, and\f",
        "the protector of the forest.\r",
        "They are known as {COLOR 1}Raikou{COLOR 0}, {COLOR 1}Entei{COLOR 0},\n",
        "{COLOR 1}Suicune{COLOR 0}, {COLOR 1}Lugia{COLOR 0}, {COLOR 1}Ho-oh{COLOR 0} and {COLOR 1}Celebi{COLOR 0}.\r",
        "Read on?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0584_T25R0201_00058",
      "en_US": [
        "The {COLOR 2}Hoenn{COLOR 0} region is known for the\n",
        "golems of rock, ice and steel,\f",
        "the twins known as the Eon Pokémon,\f",
        "the titans of water, earth and sky,\f",
        "the wishmaker and the alien virus.\r",
        "They are known as {COLOR 1}Regirock{COLOR 0}, {COLOR 1}Regice{COLOR 0},\n",
        "{COLOR 1}Registeel{COLOR 0}, {COLOR 1}Latias{COLOR 0}, {COLOR 1}Latios{COLOR 0}, {COLOR 1}Kyogre{COLOR 0},\f",
        "{COLOR 1}Groudon{COLOR 0}, {COLOR 1}Rayquaza{COLOR 0}, {COLOR 1}Jirachi{COLOR 0} and {COLOR 1}Deoxys{COLOR 0}.\r",
        "Read on?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0584_T25R0201_00059",
      "en_US": [
        "The {COLOR 2}Sinnoh{COLOR 0} region is known for the\n",
        "embodiments of knowledge, emotion and\f",
        "willpower, the creators of time, space\f",
        "and antimatter, the child of the\f",
        "planet’s core, the leader of golems,\f",
        "the protector of dreams, the prince\f",
        "of the sea, the force of nightmare,\f",
        "and the bringer of life and purity.\r",
        "They are known as {COLOR 1}Uxie{COLOR 0}, {COLOR 1}Mesprit{COLOR 0},{COLOR 1}\n",
        "Azelf{COLOR 0}, {COLOR 1}Dialga{COLOR 0}, {COLOR 1}Palkia{COLOR 0}, {COLOR 1}Giratina{COLOR 0},\f",
        "{COLOR 1}Heatran{COLOR 0}, {COLOR 1}Regigigas{COLOR 0}, {COLOR 1}Cresselia{COLOR 0},\f",
        "{COLOR 1}Manaphy{COLOR 0}, {COLOR 1}Darkrai{COLOR 0}, and {COLOR 1}Shaymin{COLOR 0}.\r",
        "Read on?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0584_T25R0201_00060",
      "en_US": [
        "Mythology also states the existence\n",
        "of another legendary belonging to the\f",
        "Sinnoh group, but little information is\f",
        "known.\r",
        "One carving suggests that this\n",
        "legendary appears only when a\f",
        "trainer has {COLOR 1}tamed every other of these\f",
        "legendary Pokémon{COLOR 0} from the four\f",
        "regions, making it a somewhat impossible \f",
        "task for our scientists.\r",
        "Read on?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0584_T25R0201_00061",
      "en_US": [
        "Whether the more common Pokémon\n",
        "{COLOR 1}Phione{COLOR 0} can be called legendary is\f",
        "unknown. There is mixed evidence, but\f",
        "for now we choose to declare\f",
        "it as a regular Pokémon.\r",
        "Read on?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0584_T25R0201_00062",
      "en_US": [
        "The {COLOR 2}Unova{COLOR 0} region is also said to\n",
        "contain a variety of legen...\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0584_T25R0201_00063",
      "en_US": [
        "The rest of the pages are blank\n",
        "or ripped..."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0584_T25R0201_00064",
      "en_US": [
        "Perhaps you would like to battle?\r",
        "I do want our Pokémon to have\n",
        "a match. Are you prepared to be\f",
        "my opponent? {YESNO 0}"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0584_T25R0201_00065",
      "en_US": [
        "Before I sent out my Pokémon,\n",
        "my heart begins to race...\r",
        "Interesting, my Pokémon in their Poké\n",
        "Balls appear to be quite happy.\r",
        "Could you be the reason?\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0584_T25R0201_00066",
      "en_US": [
        "I see.\r",
        "Perhaps a wise choice.\n",
        "My Pokémon aren’t to be taken lightly."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0584_T25R0201_00067",
      "en_US": [
        "You are indeed powerful...\n",
        "I’d expect nothing less.\r",
        "If you want to let our Pokémon\n",
        "have another chance at battle,\f",
        "please let me know."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0584_T25R0201_00068",
      "en_US": "Hey, you!"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0584_T25R0201_00069",
      "en_US": [
        "You there! Do you know Phione?\r",
        "If you can show me a Phione,\n",
        "I’ll give you a reward!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0584_T25R0201_00070",
      "en_US": [
        "By jove, it’s a real Phione!\r",
        "But that’s not enough, you see!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0584_T25R0201_00071",
      "en_US": [
        "If you can show me a Manaphy,\n",
        "then I’ll really give you a reward!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0584_T25R0201_00072",
      "en_US": [
        "By jove, it’s a real Manaphy!\r",
        "Here, take this!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0584_T25R0201_00073",
      "en_US": [
        "Thank you, young sir!\n",
        "Fare thee well!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0584_T25R0201_00074",
      "en_US": [
        "Thank you, young lass!\n",
        "Fare thee well!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0584_T25R0201_00075",
      "en_US": [
        "Cynthia: Congratulations on becoming\n",
        "the Champion, {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}.\r",
        "I’d like to give you a reward\n",
        "in celebration.\r",
        "However, first, I want you to show me\n",
        "one of the Sinnoh starters or one\f",
        "of their evolutions.\r",
        "Can you do that, {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}?\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0584_T25R0201_00076",
      "en_US": [
        "I hate to say it, but the Pokémon\n",
        "behind you isn’t what I was looking for!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0584_T25R0201_00077",
      "en_US": [
        "That is indeed one of the starters\n",
        "given out by Rowan in Sinnoh!\r",
        "So you own a {COLOR 1}{STRVAR_1 0, 1, 0}{COLOR 0}...\r",
        "In that case, I’d like you to have\n",
        "these two Pokémon!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0584_T25R0201_00078",
      "en_US": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0} received {COLOR 2}Chimchar{COLOR 0} and {COLOR 2}Piplup{COLOR 0}\n",
        "from Cynthia!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0584_T25R0201_00079",
      "en_US": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0} received {COLOR 2}Turtwig{COLOR 0} and {COLOR 2}Piplup{COLOR 0}\n",
        "from Cynthia!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0584_T25R0201_00080",
      "en_US": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0} received {COLOR 2}Turtwig{COLOR 0} and {COLOR 2}Chimchar{COLOR 0}\n",
        "from Cynthia!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0584_T25R0201_00081",
      "en_US": [
        "Cynthia: You’ll do well with them,\n",
        "I’m quite sure of that."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0584_T25R0201_00082",
      "en_US": [
        "Your party’s too full, though. If you\n",
        "can have at least two free slots, that\f",
        "would be great."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0584_T25R0201_00083",
      "en_US": [
        "Hey, mister!\n",
        "Isn’t archaeology amazing?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0584_T25R0201_00084",
      "en_US": [
        "Hey, miss!\n",
        "Isn’t archaeology amazing?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0584_T25R0201_00085",
      "en_US": [
        "Hey, mister!\n",
        "Do you wanna trade some items?\r",
        "I’ve got some stuff you’re bound\n",
        "to like!\r",
        "Top is what you want!\n",
        "Bottom is what I want! {YESNO 0}"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0584_T25R0201_00086",
      "en_US": [
        "Hey, miss!\n",
        "Do you wanna trade some items?\r",
        "I’ve got some stuff you’re bound\n",
        "to like!\r",
        "Top is what you want!\n",
        "Bottom is what I want! {YESNO 0}"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0584_T25R0201_00087",
      "en_US": [
        "Sun Stone\n",
        "Red Shard"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0584_T25R0201_00088",
      "en_US": [
        "Moon Stone\n",
        "Blue Shard"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0584_T25R0201_00089",
      "en_US": [
